---
layout: null
permalink: /season-starts.ics
---
{%- comment -%}
A subscribable calendar with one all-day event per variety on the first day
of each fully-in-season run, repeating yearly. Dates are computed from the
build year; the yearly rule keeps them valid afterwards. Tags trim only the
whitespace after themselves so that each property keeps its own line. A
variety is named as a list names it, from the baked labels: "Rhubarb
(forced)", "Apples (Cox)". Only rings that give the verdict have events
(not another coast, a glasshouse or a wild ring beside a market one), and
a food that cannot be sold has none.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign year = site.time | date: "%Y" -%}
{%- assign jan1 = year | append: "-01-01" | date: "%s" | plus: 0 %}
BEGIN:VCALENDAR
VERSION:2.0
PRODID:-//Is It Rhubarb Yet//EN
CALSCALE:GREGORIAN
X-WR-CALNAME:UK seasons
{% for food in site.data.foods -%}
{% if food.unsold -%}{% continue -%}{% endif -%}
{% assign fslug = food.slug -%}
{% assign vlabels = site.data.baked.labels[fslug] -%}
{% for v in food.varieties -%}
{% if v.lead == false -%}{% continue -%}{% endif -%}
{% assign vix = forloop.index0 -%}
{% assign vlabel = vlabels[vix] -%}
{% for r in v.weeks -%}
{% if r[2] == "in" -%}
{% assign offset = r[0] | minus: 1 | times: 604800 -%}
{% assign start = jan1 | plus: offset | date: "%Y%m%d" -%}
{% assign stop = jan1 | plus: offset | plus: 86400 | date: "%Y%m%d" -%}
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:{{ food.slug }}{% if v.name != "" %}-{{ v.name | slugify }}{% endif %}-w{{ r[0] }}@is-it-rhubarb-yet
DTSTAMP:{{ site.time | date: "%Y%m%dT%H%M%SZ" }}
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:{{ start }}
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:{{ stop }}
RRULE:FREQ=YEARLY
SUMMARY:In season: {{ food.name }}{% if vlabel != "" %} ({{ vlabel }}){% endif %}
DESCRIPTION:Week {{ r[0] }} to {{ r[1] }}. {{ site.url }}{{ site.baseurl }}/{{ food.slug }}/
END:VEVENT
{% endif -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% endfor -%}
{% endfor -%}
END:VCALENDAR
